# NV-17 — Bao cao va thong ke

UC: 188-203  
Actors: leader, coordinator, system administrator  
Status: specified; dashboard summary mocked; report builder pending.

## Mandatory reports

Reception/processing summary; progress by unit; on-time/overdue rate; topic distribution; unanswered list; overdue questions; transfer history; returned/revision list; complex/extended questions; answered/published questions; public usefulness; workload by officer; SLA trend; source/channel; legal-basis usage; system quality.

## Acceptance criteria

- Every report records filter period, scope, generated time and source snapshot.
- Export respects permission and masks personal fields.
- Metrics use the same state/SLA definitions as NV-05 and NV-14.
- Empty, partial and failed data states are explicit.

## Test mapping

`report.repository.spec.ts`, `report-calculation.service.spec.ts` (planned).

